</span></span>
<span id="S1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2.pic1.1.4" class="ltx_p"><span id="S1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2.pic1.1.4.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Latest stars: Martin Johnson -200
</span></span>
<span id="S1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2.pic1.1.5" class="ltx_p"><span id="S1.SS0.SSS0.Px3.p2.pic1.1.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_typewriter" style="font-size:90%;--ltx-fg-color:#000000;">Latest Supporter: Emeka Efobi
</span></span>
</span></span></span></foreignObject></g></g></svg></span>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S1.SS0.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Faithful extractions.</h5>

<div id="S1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S1.SS0.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We are especially concerned about extracted claims where LLM hallucinations introduce content not present in the original post. An example of a hallucinated and overly verbose claim follows:</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S1.SS0.SSS0.Px5" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Social Media Post:</h5>

<div id="S1.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1" class="ltx_para ltx_noindent"><span class="ltx_inline-block"><svg id="S1.SS0.SSS0.Px5.p1.pic1" class="ltx_picture" height="159.04" overflow="visible" version="1.1" viewBox="0 0 477.38 159.04" width="477.38"><g style="--ltx-stroke-color:#000000;--ltx-fill-color:#000000;" fill="#000000" stroke="#000000" stroke-width="0.4pt" transform="translate(0,159.04) matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 0)"><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#008000;" fill="#008000" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0 3.46 L 0 155.58 C 0 157.49 1.55 159.04 3.46 159.04 L 473.92 159.04 C 475.83 159.04 477.38 157.49 477.38 155.58 L 477.38 3.46 C 477.38 1.55 475.83 0 473.92 0 L 3.46 0 C 1.55 0 0 1.55 0 3.46 Z"></path></g><g style="--ltx-fill-color:#F2FFF2;" fill="#F2FFF2" fill-opacity="1.0"><path style="stroke:none" d="M 0.69 3.46 L 0.69 155.58 C 0.69 157.11 1.93 158.35 3.46 158.35 L 473.92 158.35 C 475.45 158.35 476.68 157.11 476.68 155.58 L 476.68 3.46 C 476.68 1.93 475.45 0.69 473.92 0.69 L 3.46 0.69 C 1.93 0.69 0.69 1.93 0.69 3.46 Z"></path></g><g fill-opacity="1.0" transform="matrix(1.0 0.0 0.0 1.0 10.16 10.16)"><foreignObject style="--ltx-fo-width:34.95em;--ltx-fo-height:10.23em;--ltx-fo-depth:0.2em;font-size:10pt;" height="144.25" overflow="visible" transform="matrix(1 0 0 -1 0 141.49)" width="483.61"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_container"><span class="ltx_foreignobject_content">
