<br class="ltx_break"></p>
</div></li>
</ul>
</div>
<div id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p3" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px2.p3.1" class="ltx_p">This model extracts short, concise claims that are easy to verify. However, the claims are often overly literal and fail to capture the deeper meaning or intent behind the social media post.</p>
</div>
</section>
<section id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Fine-tuned DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Lama-8b</h5>

<div id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">METEOR score: 0.2541 , described in Section <a href="#S2.SS3" title="2.3 Fine-tuned DeepSeek-R1-Distill-Llama-8b Approach ‣ 2 Approaches: Fine-Tuning and Prompting ‣ UNH at CheckThat! 2025: Fine-tuning Vs Prompting in Claim Extraction" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2.3</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<div id="S5.SS2.SSS0.Px3.p2" class="ltx_para">
<ul id="S5.I3" class="ltx_itemize">
<li id="S5.I3.i1" class="ltx_item" style="list-style-type:none;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_item">•</span> 
<div id="S5.I3.i1.p1" class="ltx_para">
